1
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,308
Evening. I was told this is where the serious smokers come.

2
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,155
Serious is a strong word.

3
00:00:11,855 --> 00:00:12,949
We have Gus.

4
00:00:13,717 --> 00:00:19,587
Gus Pappas. Thirty-one years in this chair. I can name any cigar on Earth. Blindfolded.

5
00:00:20,342 --> 00:00:24,571
Any cigar? Bold claim. I review cigars professionally.

6
00:00:25,021 --> 00:00:27,617
Online. Forty thousand followers.

7
00:00:28,383 --> 00:00:30,160
He has followers, Gus.

8
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,310
Then let's give him a show. Dee. The towel.

9
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:37,566
One mystery cigar. Try not to hurt yourself.

10
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:43,314
Mmm. Nicaraguan wrapper. Cedar. Leather. A little dark chocolate.

11
00:00:43,914 --> 00:00:47,660
And, if I'm not mistaken... my uncle's tool shed. Nineteen eighty-four.

12
00:00:48,425 --> 00:00:50,180
That's... remarkably specific.

13
00:00:51,125 --> 00:00:53,236
Gus. It's not lit.

14
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:00,282
Lighting it is for amateurs. You taste the potential.

15
00:01:01,175 --> 00:01:06,841
Gus has been coming here for eleven years. He has never once lit a cigar.

16
00:01:07,541 --> 00:01:09,351
I sell him one every night.

17
00:01:10,251 --> 00:01:12,589
It's been the same cigar since March.

18
00:01:14,575 --> 00:01:18,063
Nigel. Rookie mistake. You're burning off all the flavor.
